/**
 * TASK: Write the checks that decide whether a MultipleSummer is correct.
 *
 *   sumBelow(limit) adds up every whole number BELOW limit that is a multiple
 *   of 3 or of 5. A number that is a multiple of both is counted once.
 *   limit of 0 or less gives 0.
 *   Examples: sumBelow(10) -> 23   (3 + 5 + 6 + 9)
 *             sumBelow(16) -> 60   (3+5+6+9+10+12+15)
 *             sumBelow(15) -> 45   (15 itself is NOT below 15)
